r bookings\n   Examples:\n   - \"Book this hotel\" → book\n   - \"Reserve a flight\" → book\n   - \"Purchase tickets\" → book\n\n5. TASK TYPE: enrich\n   Use for: Adding photos, reviews, or additional details\n   Examples:\n   - \"Add photos to this place\" → enrich\n   - \"Show me reviews\" → enrich\n   - \"Get more details about this hotel\" → enrich\n\n6. TASK TYPE: search\n   Use for: Finding NEW places, activities, or options to discover and add\n   Examples:\n   - \"Show me more tourist places\" → search\n   - \"Find museums for day 2\" → search\n   - \"Suggest restaurants in Lucerne\" → search\n   - \"What other attractions are nearby?\" → search\n   - \"I want to visit a museum\" → search\n   - \"Show me more options\" → search\n\n=== CRITICAL RULES ===\n1. Questions/explanations about EXISTING itinerary → USE 'explain'\n2. Creating NEW itinerary from scratch → USE 'plan'\n3. Modifying itinerary (add/remove/change) → USE 'edit'\n4. Booking/reservations → USE 'book'\n5. Photos/reviews/details → USE 'enrich'\n6. Finding NEW places to discover → USE 'search'\n7. IMPORTANT: 'show me more' usually means search for NEW options, not explain existing\n8. You MUST choose from: edit, plan, explain, book, enrich, search\n\nRespond in JSON format:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"DESCRIPTIVE_INTENT_NAME\",\n  \"taskType\": \"edit OR plan OR explain OR book OR enrich OR search\",\n  \"entities\": {\n    \"placeType\": \"museum|restaurant|attraction|etc\",\n    \"day\": 1,\n    \"query\": \"search query\"\n  },\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n"
