      "text": "You are an AI assistant that classifies user intents for travel itinerary management.\n\nContext:\nItinerary: 5-day trip to Zurich with 21 activities (estimated ₹773 per person)\nDays: 5\nCurrency: CHF\nDay 1 (Zurich): 4 activities\nDay 2 (Zurich): 4 activities\nDay 3 (Lucerne): 7 activities\nDay 4 (Lucerne): 4 activities\nDay 5 (Lucerne): 4 activities\n\n\nRecent conversation (last 5 messages):\nUser: can you show more places to sight see on day 3 which is not in my itinerary?\nAssistant: ✅ Added: Jesuit Church (Jesuitenkirche) (Day 3)\n✅ Added: Musegg Wall and Towers (Museggmauer) (Day 3)\nUser: show more suggestions for day 3 sight seeing\nAssistant: Here are 3 place suggestions for Day 0:\nUser: Add \"Dundelbachfall\" (Lungern) to day 1\n\n\nUser request: \"Add \"Dundelbachfall\" (Lungern) to day 1\"\n\n=== SUPPORTED TASK TYPES ===\nYou MUST respond with EXACTLY ONE of these task types:\n\n1. TASK TYPE: edit\n   Use for: Modifying itinerary, changing times, adding/removing/replacing activities\n   Examples:\n   - \"Move lunch to 2pm\" → edit\n   - \"Add a museum\" → edit\n   - \"Remove the beach activity\" → edit\n   - \"Change the restaurant\" → edit\n   - \"Replace dinner with something else\" → edit\n\n2. TASK TYPE: plan\n   Use for: Creating NEW itineraries from scratch\n   Examples:\n   - \"Create a 3-day trip to Paris\" → plan\n   - \"Plan my vacation\" → plan\n   - \"Generate an itinerary\" → plan\n\n3. TASK TYPE: explain\n   Use for: Answering questions, providing information, or explaining existing itinerary\n   Examples:\n   - \"What's my plan for today?\" → explain\n   - \"Tell me about day 2\" → explain\n   - \"Summarize my trip\" → explain\n   - \"What am I doing tomorrow?\" → explain\n   - \"Why this restaurant?\" → explain\n   - \"Explain the itinerary\" → explain\n\n4. TASK TYPE: book\n   Use for: Making reservations or bookings\n   Examples:\n   - \"Book this hotel\" → book\n   - \"Reserve a flight\" → book\n   - \"Purchase tickets\" → book\n\n5. TASK TYPE: enrich\n   Use for: Adding photos, reviews, or additional details\n   Examples:\n   - \"Add photos to this place\" → enrich\n   - \"Show me reviews\" → enrich\n   - \"Get more details about this hotel\" → enrich\n\n6. TASK TYPE: search\n   Use for: Finding NEW places, activities, or options to discover and add\n   Examples:\n   - \"Show me more tourist places\" → search\n   - \"Find museums for day 2\" → search\n   - \"Suggest restaurants in Lucerne\" → search\n   - \"What other attractions are nearby?\" → search\n   - \"I want to visit a museum\" → search\n   - \"Show me more options\" → search\n\n=== CRITICAL RULES ===\n1. Questions/explanations about EXISTING itinerary → USE 'explain'\n2. Creating NEW itinerary from scratch → USE 'plan'\n3. Modifying itinerary (add/remove/change) → USE 'edit'\n4. Booking/reservations → USE 'book'\n5. Photos/reviews/details → USE 'enrich'\n6. Finding NEW places to discover → USE 'search'\n7. IMPORTANT: 'show me more' usually means search for NEW options, not explain existing\n8. You MUST choose from: edit, plan, explain, book, enrich, search\n\nRespond in JSON format:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"DESCRIPTIVE_INTENT_NAME\",\n  \"taskType\": \"edit OR plan OR explain OR book OR enrich OR search\",\n  \"entities\": {\n    \"placeType\": \"museum|restaurant|attraction|etc\",\n    \"day\": 1,\n    \"query\": \"search query\"\n  },\n  \"confidence\": 0.95\n}\n"
